<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset Your Password - Bell N Desk</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7fa; color: #333;">

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f4f7fa;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 10px;">
                
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); overflow: hidden;">
                    
                    <tr>
                        <td height="250" style="background-image: url('https://i.ibb.co/cXZMWj0q/Whats-App-Image-2026-01-13-at-4-26-32-PM.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
                            
                            <div style="display: inline-block; background: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 20px; padding: 6px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                <span style="color: #d97706; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                                    Security Account
                                </span>
                            </div>

                            <h2 style="color: #000; margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800;">Password Reset Request</h2>
                            
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0; color: #556b8d; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center;">
                                Hi <strong style="color: #1b7cff;"><%= name %></strong>,
                            </p>

                            <p style="color: #666; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
                                We received a request to reset your password for your Bell N Desk account. No changes have been made yet. You can reset your password by clicking the button below:
                            </p>
                            
                            <a href="<%= link %>" style="background: #0F3C60; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 18px 45px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 18px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(27,124,255,0.2); margin-bottom: 30px;">
                                Reset Password →
                            </a>

                            <div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
                                <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                                    <strong>Didn't request this?</strong> If you didn't mean to reset your password, you can safely ignore this email. Your account is still secure.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color: #0F3C60; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                            <p style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600;">
                                © 2026 Bell N Desk LLC. All rights reserved.
                            </p>
                            <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 12px; margin: 8px 0 0 0;">
                                Building thriving learning communities together.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>